1554	avalon_20251201_035439	proposal	100200	Charlie	good	\N	Mission 1 (Alice + Charlie) succeeded, which slightly increases Alice’s town-cred but doesn’t hard-clear her, and tells us nothing about Diana or Eve yet. I’ve been arguing we should avoid auto-locking the exact Mission 1 core and instead take exactly one of Alice/Charlie plus two new players so Mission 2 actually generates new information. This team does that: it keeps Alice as the carry-over from Mission 1 and brings in both Diana and Eve, giving us a strong info test on two completely unknowns while keeping Bob off a second consecutive small mission (which several people were wary of). The result will sharply shape reads on both Diana and Eve relative to Alice’s growing track record, and if this passes clean we’ll have a much more reliable pool for later larger missions.	[-0.05133987,-0.027342923,-0.0042613805,-0.002820135,0.02074399,-0.0024910178,-0.022658305,-0.032639798,-0.053428993,0.059244093,-0.023656642,-0.020958718,0.025102643,-0.10572331,-0.006650217,0.041508183,0.018298203,-0.03271092,-0.019326093,0.028823659,-0.03953089,-0.08833854,0.042619698,0.082762055,0.039157286,0.07223127,-0.045015577,-0.019652855,-0.038913794,-0.07774372,0.01321981,0.09078945,0.08523798,0.05060919,0.042487487,0.032410994,0.022452824,0.03348193,0.049744718,-0.033854544,0.007838192,-0.05044341,-0.0025839196,-0.018881798,-0.017343806,0.026491994,0.037870474,0.06471345,0.0077967513,0.03641062,0.00373904,-0.03580319,-0.035777763,-0.010632684,0.019218476,0.06371398,-0.057125185,0.022974884,-0.053793743,0.034943618,-0.03501824,0.035750445,-0.0064513367,0.020982318,0.048888613,-0.022353554,-0.069950216,-0.048276186,-0.0031048402,-0.028261907,0.064837456,0.030731652,-0.1074338,-0.103599064,-0.009184352,0.023849994,0.011923331,0.006093888,-0.01893867,-0.045245156,-0.016785547,-0.12874685,0.04857884,0.052458677,-0.058999337,-0.07166831,-0.018768119,-0.06617687,0.014664138,-0.013063261,-0.0074250037,-0.046171363,0.045815926,0.06681