1523	avalon_20251201_034434	proposal	100301	Bob	evil	\N	Mission 1 (Alice + Charlie) was clean, Mission 2 (Alice + Diana + Eve) had a single fail, so the only confirmed safe structure we have so far is that Charlie was on a successful small team and that the fail must have come from within {Alice, Diana, Eve}. Putting Charlie with me gives us (1) our most trusted anchor so far and (2) fresh information from a player who hasn’t been on a mission yet, while (3) keeping both Diana and Eve off the team after their involvement in the failed mission. If this mission succeeds, it strongly narrows evil to {Alice, Diana, Eve}; if it fails, it very cleanly points at me as suspicious, which is still valuable information for the table going into Missions 4 and 5.	[-0.0239753,0.01164928,-0.023584308,-0.021940028,0.012738666,-0.0038456935,0.033389144,-0.0142147085,-0.021210324,0.06497866,-0.021193989,0.012055751,0.10211616,-0.08128916,-0.022709584,0.08249914,0.023372665,0.008060862,-0.05438178,0.051598795,-0.11215888,-0.057856426,-0.0072060926,0.026594946,-0.033232,0.07178867,-0.0071141655,0.008590848,-0.040931668,-0.13866429,0.013734024,0.015412548,0.012686342,0.05706855,0.029817283,0.045934167,0.03432613,-0.06522547,0.042805213,-0.006454262,-0.017149443,-0.050337076,0.010267773,-0.004255383,-0.032971136,0.0052813343,0.02222797,0.009401044,0.006258041,-0.038602937,-0.065616354,0.02472502,-0.0043347045,0.023967577,-0.0065551195,0.033260465,-0.0356483,0.003951761,-0.045381255,0.06206061,0.0029796662,0.09008586,-0.035256512,0.017388824,0.04341776,0.024612697,-0.095208436,-0.03955203,-0.008193527,0.039760128,0.03778976,-0.070964344,-0.08998723,-0.08390706,-0.080207676,0.03051627,0.058562305,-0.040814772,0.02054576,-0.02356284,-0.028499607,-0.08690385,-0.031033637,0.102640174,0.0043761954,-0.01754365,-0.012954286,-0.07022956,0.054011773,0.01295555,0.019502796,-0.04405318,0.09196596,0.08830639,0.084665194,0.04375422,-0.017927935,-0.0034590003,-0.005195632,0.09446878,-0.02597605,0.07008