1635	avalon_20251201_041734	proposal	100500	Diana	evil	\N	Given the information we have, the overlap between the Mission 3 and Mission 4 fails makes Alice and Charlie the most suspicious cluster: Mission 3 showed a fail with just Bob and Charlie, strongly implicating Charlie from Bob’s perspective, and Mission 4’s fail on Alice/Diana/Eve adds at least one evil among those three. Since we know there’s exactly one evil in {Bob, Charlie} and one in {Diana, Eve}, the configurations that still make structural sense and avoid the heaviest overlap suspicion are ones that exclude Alice and Charlie together. Reusing the exact Mission 2 team of Alice/Bob/Eve risks the double-overlap on Alice (M2 and M4), whereas Bob/Diana/Eve keeps Bob (widely trusted after M1 and M2) and Eve (cleared from the Bob/Charlie fail) while dropping Alice and Charlie, who sit at the intersection of the two failing patterns. This is the least conflicted, most justifiable combination left for a final mission.	[-0.010676187,-0.029428452,0.00022237757,-0.052027095,0.05854477,-0.028728738,-0.040568173,-0.042801667,0.012284421,0.028792674,0.0035142195,0.028241105,0.081290305,-0.09994593,0.018747538,0.03896784,-0.0016098279,-0.008529382,-0.043089118,0.03237444,-0.0812485,-0.08827636,-0.006014515,0.037002627,-0.055951364,0.08419373,0.003986191,-0.013515528,-0.031114778,-0.114737146,0.0443931,0.085074805,0.0046551162,0.00018386035,0.0129732685,0.03606001,0.014905995,0.0017079002,0.03931166,0.008650216,0.005283385,-0.011055084,0.021229893,-0.04696427,-0.058225702,0.0077708317,-0.0053438577,0.01672209,0.031565152,-0.06337489,0.008683969,-0.0358198,-0.025692577,0.040439118,0.005038887,-0.0064326376,-0.051871665,0.041069187,-0.0067309616,0.044371482,0.0024452233,0.064545795,-0.050925788,0.0209354,0.091892116,0.042017736,-0.039545767,-0.017662585,-0.014863339,0.044379257,0.054319676,-0.031809874,-0.10121207,-0.07646202,-0.053871773,0.070326045,0.07395447,-0.01146116,0.025191361,-0.03386298,-0.010062438,-0.0514892