1664	avalon_20251201_042616	proposal	100400	Diana	good	\N	Mission 2 had two FAILs with team [Alice, Bob, Eve], so both evils must be within that triple, which structurally clears Charlie and Diana. That makes Charlie and Diana the safest core for Mission 4. For the third slot, we have to pick one of {Alice, Bob, Eve}. Bob has been pushing back on the structural implication that both evils are in the Mission 2 team, which I find slightly concerning, and Eve was directly on the double-fail team. Alice was also on that team, but she was part of the clean Mission 1 as well, and her logic this round is at least aligned with locking in the structurally cleared players. Given all that, the lowest-risk composition I see is Alice, Charlie, and Diana.	[0.0015733743,0.012684659,-0.01701103,-0.065892756,0.009795724,0.032808732,-0.0446673,0.0025366817,-0.011944287,0.070504375,-0.01821176,-0.00063419907,0.052394506,-0.07510837,-0.0023079454,0.04944122,0.010252875,0.040136684,-0.021343619,0.05488263,-0.07007834,-0.062251877,-0.011847886,0.027701158,-0.029025633,0.079176016,-0.025683945,0.01257476,-0.01877538,-0.113547824,0.0030932527,0.031123897,0.04311548,0.021457864,0.00044002628,0.03150014,0.0162419,-0.03245395,0.029888663,-0.010037745,-0.017380202,-0.005067965,-0.045593105,-0.031478953,-0.05853976,-0.04362778,0.030765668,-0.040685225,0.011390239,-0.08490583,0.004117566,-0.019468052,-0.033559505,0.020641185,0.005037004,-0.021436172,-0.050030734,-0.006966795,-0.04079992,0.053199373,0.0440366,0.052422456,-0.033958793,0.01442846,0.07909768,0.0026722464,-0.032639906,-0.033719916,-0.02804608,0.03427554,0.023264036,-0.06902391,-0.07180192,-0.1684383,-0.036292605,0.08236958,0.07521704,-0.02991141,0.024444886,-0.050621193,0.038654897,-0.08087456,0.042957798,0.06513191,-0.005964407,0.013811993,-0.071867876,-0.11885435,0.074190885,0.03540809,0.015600442,-0.0070514265,0.12869862,0.093540244,0.106742285,0.043980293,-0.04125467,-0.02068388,-0.002038586,0.073223755,-0.077967644,0.03267855,-0