1907	avalon_20251201_051414	proposal	100302	Eve	good	\N	Two consecutive clean missions with Alice and Bob as the common core makes them the statistically safest pair. If either were evil, burning two early passes together is an unusually risky long-con line, especially with good already at 2–0. Reusing this proven pair for a 2-person mission minimizes variance and forces any future fail to come from elsewhere, giving us clearer info going into the larger Mission 4.	[0.017716976,0.01780994,-0.033957213,-0.032043703,0.028938422,0.023481503,-0.049007326,-0.056286514,-0.019130493,0.059120085,-0.030132307,0.07344608,0.03192798,-0.049128506,0.061149273,0.044504825,-0.0008195538,0.018700745,-0.040710747,0.0589521,-0.05156174,-0.06707369,-0.014959631,0.014962472,-0.034806024,0.0006933716,0.017301254,-0.025508506,-0.028201994,-0.06140545,0.037665147,0.014300017,-0.04269902,0.011169054,0.0054553826,0.030532086,0.0152063165,0.011272236,0.024419595,0.0050530457,0.0059996187,-0.041985523,-0.0022549778,-0.035617538,-0.08161951,0.002912359,-0.0032312248,-0.09285023,0.053101767,-0.07065451,0.06273562,0.042628128,-0.025047775,0.008822602,0.08645429,-0.042032056,-0.09588832,-0.007673085,-0.040517393,0.041546658,-0.034683976,0.011818274,-0.06023058,-0.01936758,0.06311884,-0.03285642,-0.009755682,-0.044623967,0.05356348,0.09389544,-0.046204194,0.019294823,-0.0532365,-0.14965388,-0.024311895,0.022300005,0.012123116,-0.015486889,-0.069264755,-0.055394787,0.022585804,-0.10686823,0.02674508,0.028963223,0.020165825,0.03567508,-0.03812256,-0.06879563,0.087834544,-0.015929349,0.027873697,0.035826858,0.16076879,0.036973897,0.04685199,0.0061943866,-0.017270314,0.027226102,-0.012346367,0.06874082,0.0025559163,0.023520667,-0.021245671,-0.042850424,0.12585181,-0.0024415015,0.053650558,-0.049785323,0.013161007,-0.0581091,0.08221033,0.03051528,0.013115595,-0.0019659784,-0.018665845,0.059856933,-0.015173773,0.057091776,0.0010704685,-0.018795867,0.018003598,-0.033243753,0.11896887,0.018209655,-0.04451