2045	avalon_20251201_054906	proposal	100500	Charlie	good	\N	Alice/Charlie have two separate clean missions together (M1 and M3), which makes both of them the safest core we have. That pushes both evil players into the remaining three: Bob, Diana, Eve. Mission 4’s fail came from [Alice, Charlie, Diana]; since Alice/Charlie have already been clean twice and I know I played success, Diana is the most likely culprit there. That leaves the second evil in {Bob, Eve}, both of whom were on the failed Mission 2. Between them, Bob’s eagerness to lock in Alice/Charlie/Bob as the ‘low-variance’ team despite being part of that failed mission feels more like agenda-driven positioning, while Eve has at least been consistent about not wanting both Alice and Bob on the same final team. Given we have to pick one of Bob/Eve, I’m more comfortable taking Eve and avoiding both the clear Mission 4 suspect (Diana) and the player from Mission 2 who’s pushing hardest to be included (Bob).	[0.019438276,0.012298856,0.02176497,-0.07097481,0.03831216,0.018108236,-0.039871078,-0.014308892,0.02221398,0.07556611,-0.03721774,-0.010649251,0.049077746,-0.059879653,0.04742468,0.05266525,0.022710605,0.012490771,-0.032759197,0.053536877,-0.07599634,-0.07232656,0.030197553,-0.015464662,-0.039424267,0.065259255,0.00819739,-0.014597564,-0.016984707,-0.11316986,0.032485258,0.035875335,0.02546929,0.00021072739,0.009887233,0.035623293,-0.025119908,-0.03268224,0.028883455,0.000358206,0.009194983,0.007860041,-0.050480857,-0.03651671,-0.07195363,-0.015532413,0.04474127,0.006220032,0.03293683,-0.0863712,0.009506364,-0.026858084,-0.03140638,0.013290368,-0.011416271,0.01773827,-0.03266968,0.01969501,-0.021320729,0.061894566,-0.008634127,0.05873605,-0.02597212,0.0114829065,0.053796988,0.032189406,-0.027016979,-0.014835598,-0.04757063,0.047505833,0.05425094,-0.035570785,-0.079158984,-0.10621312,-0.06260258,0.03334742,0.08572277,0.0034230393,0.03178341,-0.014474777,0.015328749,-0.08612145,-0.0110627655,0.061895516,0.00