2149	avalon_20251201_060806	proposal	100400	Bob	evil	\N	I’m deliberately keeping myself off since several of you are uneasy about me after Mission 3, and I don’t want this to get auto-rejected just because I’m on it. We need a team that most of the table can at least tentatively live with. Diana is the closest thing we have to a consensus trust pick. Alice has been on both fails, but she’s also on everyone’s preferred teams when they talk about who they actually trust, so completely sidelining her now feels like overcorrecting based on thin information from single-fail missions. For the third slot, it’s basically Charlie vs. Eve: Eve is very locked into a specific ‘Bob + Charlie evil’ narrative, which could be either sharp good play or agenda-driven; Charlie has a mixed record (one success, one fail) but is at least more in the middle rather than hard-pushing one story. Given that, I think the most balanced, realistically approvable compromise is Alice + Charlie + Diana: it avoids the most controversial pick (me), keeps our strongest trust read (Diana), and includes one of the contested players (Charlie) so we’re not just blindly following a single narrative without testing it.	[-0.010171795,-0.04485547,-0.010659031,-0.02422469,0.019122005,0.025939338,-0.019518854,0.008386279,0.059297256,0.08995182,-0.098611176,-0.057254203,0.043492965,-0.041239776,0.019923817,0.02715728,0.040333934,0.027142381,0.00087900617,0.0401181,-0.10796535,-0.06340581,-0.0096399095,0.013119125,-0.025320444,-0.02015231,-0.015331835,0.02652134,-0.07919832,-0.13603036,-0.017058631,0.030026194,0.041421305,0.013360737,0.017072752,0.0061682723,-0.010267495,-0.02567923,0.015351625,0.011043611,0.0058713383,-0.026619615,0.011363924,-0.01671424,-0.06667129,-0.0557551,0.02909097,0.032891437,-0.027501095,-0.012076696,-0.058151707,-0.0011391062,0.0016567516,-0.0033303273,-0.0017358492,0.041528072,-0.02253278,0.009175526,-0.0077524963,-0.03758253,0.014936266,0.055593714,-0.054837868,-0.018665273,0.04236776