870	avalon_20251130_234947	proposal	100401	Eve	evil	\N	This team keeps Charlie off, which addresses the group’s concern about his involvement in multiple failed missions, but also breaks the pattern of Alice being on every single mission so far. If we run Alice–Bob–Diana now and it succeeds, we actually learn very little beyond what we already suspect. By going with Bob–Diana–Eve, we test a new combination that still leans on players most people feel relatively good about (Bob and Diana), while giving us clearer information about whether the failures are really tied to Charlie, Alice, or to me. It’s the best balance between addressing current suspicions and maximizing what we learn from this mission’s outcome.	[0.0023565472,0.0013259263,0.004851883,-0.031380434,0.043343574,0.041345704,0.044355817,-0.030453118,-0.026172072,0.035487417,-0.04951634,0.04186903,0.05126276,-0.08373153,0.0073126503,0.052533537,0.005863151,-0.018951325,-0.05078152,0.0026689374,-0.11598715,-0.06184978,0.030780055,0.06383516,-0.06463695,0.06322705,0.010292149,-0.03097182,-0.0772645,-0.069186874,0.013368186,0.057517014,0.025856959,0.025518052,0.039657596,0.06045102,9.354811e-05,0.02157049,0.011134728,-0.029317012,0.02103559,-0.104122795,0.00413219,-0.02431187,-0.053865038,-0.021209009,0.04175767,-0.002683621,0.0188327,-0.013722004,-0.029706547,-0.09075424,0.020982012,-0.07551001,0.021778073,0.029653555,0.0030879315,0.014155244,-0.018451603,0.027956791,-0.0061940057,0.04353076,-0.06064784,0.04052944,0.049679063,0.001137393,-0.068290696,-0.005323904,-0.019891055,0.056296274,0.025520878,-0.027071143,-0.075356,-0.06319306,-0.07191116,0.053813014,0.057656184,-0.05391832,0.07454232,-0.0029221734,0.004743274,-0.10302027,-0.002461929,0.07968451,-0.0056448686,-0.03897286,0.0053622876,-0.09684833,-0.02018426,-0.009048797,-0.038369987,-0.05163341,0.09832155,0.07118769,0.027254023,0.06237347,-0.016435059,-0.013610636,-0.054788556,0.102683134,-0.024496617,0.058420196,0.01255319,-0.096899815,-0.017477168,-0