866	avalon_20251130_234947	proposal	100300	Alice	good	\N	Mission 1 (Alice + Charlie) was clean, and Mission 2 only failed when Bob was added to the otherwise successful Alice–Charlie pair, which makes Bob the single most suspicious player so far, with some residual suspicion on Charlie just for being in that cluster. Diana and Eve are the only players who have not yet been on a mission; from the failure pattern we know at least one of {Alice, Bob, Charlie} is evil, which means at most one of {Diana, Eve} can be evil. From my perspective as Alice (and knowing I am good), the highest-safety option is to pair myself with a currently untainted player rather than re-using someone from the failing mission. Between the fresh options, Alice + Diana has had broader support in discussion (and keeps the most suspicious player, Bob, off the team) while still giving us strong odds of a clean result and useful information. Therefore, I propose Alice and Diana.	[-0.026098361,-0.018800318,-0.047754478,-0.06954322,0.0033468995,0.042486437,0.05562625,0.017752683,-0.037571717,0.056169353,-0.013862503,0.014254504,0.09250951,-0.058413155,0.024807572,0.052476797,0.03792366,0.014274142,-0.01488946,0.03345917,-0.13400121,-0.0938758,-0.026974175,0.01692055,-0.05721188,0.036523208,0.029205544,-0.023763781,-0.092227794,-0.1055086,0.017554505,0.030580569,0.05231897,0.02585395,0.0037964385,0.047475275,-0.013828178,-0.025646927,0.017845597,-0.036250003,0.0022782118,-0.046331357,-0.016630987,-0.04542658,-0.08457848,-0.061207697,0.038707092,0.030243061,0.05457599,-0.022527764,-0.0131619675,-0.009090691,-0.0050015757,0.040121447,0.044067148,0.013003825,-0.027762063,0.01975559,-0.046649326,0.02906823,-0.011753684,0.09219098,-0.008085063,-0.015592406,0.056738425,0.04644333,-0.083167925,-0.0018399557,0.011631858,0.09255353,0.022205032,-0.041620012,-0.08037535,-0.10483851,-0.09827606,0.041675486,0.0686418,-0.055686075,0.051492415,0.021579983,-0.0005298864,-0.033617247,-0.01853031,0.06763447,-0.00552243