867	avalon_20251130_234947	proposal	100301	Bob	good	\N	I know I’m good, so from my perspective at least one of Alice or Charlie must be evil, since the only fail happened when I joined their previously clean pair. That means both Alice and Charlie are too risky for a tight 2-person mission. The remaining candidates are Diana and Eve; among those two there can be at most one evil, so pairing myself (confirmed good to me) with one of them gives the highest chance of a clean team. Between Diana and Eve, Diana’s comments have been more balanced and less agenda-driven than Eve’s push for a Diana–Eve team that excludes me entirely, so I slightly trust Diana more and propose Bob + Diana.	[-0.04334486,-0.0061553097,0.0006107056,-0.06814698,-0.03634211,0.022214785,-0.02103451,-0.025076196,-0.027123129,0.04330428,-0.08409946,-0.016666878,0.050356172,-0.07758469,0.028273664,0.07798216,0.036498647,0.014516596,-0.033688966,0.094320446,-0.11236905,-0.10453405,0.030770618,-0.005611572,-0.024977509,0.054439645,0.01811115,-0.037927836,-0.044945564,-0.09382566,-0.012487324,0.022893233,0.02232619,0.033619944,-0.0034567933,-0.0051874337,-0.019278504,-0.009036137,0.025903197,-0.022810735,0.020353066,-0.078703746,-0.041591503,-0.049117636,-0.08375603,-0.012049311,0.044901036,0.026691047,0.016342513,-0.074360326,0.006506847,-0.028668383,0.007193203,-0.059695266,-0.0069296486,0.023280958,-0.03984546,-0.027737394,-0.013699289,0.033574693,-0.01731207,0.10399535,-0.031032832,0.017675469,0.06473295,-0.0009996912,-0.036994554,0.036902696,-0.05552804,0.040026084,0.01644151,-0.057169586,-0.08212899,-0.11468076,-0.050355956,0.03743205,0.08857901,-0.041591387,0.052933335,0.030845601,-0.037107002,-0.052233968,0.002623974,0.099185966,0.052338194,-0.024260247,-0.058543544,-0.08027456,0.06238131,0.009960726,-0.053679228,0.0012212455,0.1092378,0.09793777,0.0989272,0.08159394,-0.0021035988,0.0041700783,-0.024444405,0.09791467,-0.107091516,0.11371221,-0.024317926,-0.058890466,0.045349687,-0.023402087,0.04