1242	avalon_20251201_020734	proposal	100402	Alice	good	\N	Mission 1 (Alice, Diana) succeeded, Mission 2 (Alice, Bob, Diana) failed with 1 fail, and Mission 3 (Alice, Charlie) failed with 1 fail. Since I know I’m good, the 2‑person fail on Mission 3 means Charlie must be evil. Mission 2 then tells us at least one of {Bob, Diana} is evil; with exactly two evils total, that forces Eve to be good and exactly one of {Bob, Diana} to be evil. So the only structurally safe core is me (Alice) plus Eve, and we should include at most one of {Bob, Diana}. Between them, Diana has a prior clean mission with me and reads more naturally good from discussion than Bob, who has been pushing hardest to frame me off all teams. Therefore the best 3-player team to maximize the chance of success is Alice, Diana, and Eve, keeping the confirmed suspect Charlie completely off the mission and limiting exposure to at most one of the Bob/Diana pair.	[0.012182748,-0.010477735,-0.04024152,-0.09309442,0.035590947,-0.0023803418,0.009800977,0.026069384,0.016710512,0.07781815,-0.08244365,-0.035690583,0.07810197,-0.053092994,0.026255611,0.04211815,0.055797562,0.060783338,-0.040751297,0.016970392,-0.08007021,-0.077626556,0.029456258,0.012693146,-0.051189583,0.05105615,-0.030373143,-0.030555602,-0.05165724,-0.10619919,-0.009069486,-0.012494465,0.06253777,0.030829722,0.02739655,0.038319618,-0.069688804,-0.044577293,0.00067511614,0.015684875,-0.01145587,-0.018608533,-0.00806428,-0.06051945,-0.057701834,-0.0097279735,0.0072811986,0.03545283,0.0568456,-0.06764043,-0.03870774,-0.03964704,-0.010319822,0.020675786,-0.0005384516,0.018551333,-0.030973995,0.025119869,-0.017254442,0.027640969,0.029151347,0.047019877,-0.040794913,0.005041589,0.11733583,0.054462716,-0.03151223,0.0019331067,-0.06824884,0.095741786,0.045168787,-0.06831662,-0.10068604,-0.06461386,-0.04214628,0.051596936,0.09260334,-0.052241713,0.039581902,0.008293612,0.0036934563,-0.059458304,0.0037386017,0.090725,0.009964343,-0.06399474,-0.060288817,-0