1293	avalon_20251201_023003	proposal	100400	Bob	good	\N	From the mission results, there is exactly one evil in {Alice, Eve} and one in {Charlie, Diana}. So any all-good team must be me (Bob) plus one from each pair. The key is whose behavior better fits being evil given that evil is already up 2–1.\n\nEve and Charlie are strongly aligned on pushing [Bob, Eve, Charlie], which would contain both of them if they are the evil pair. Eve is also very insistent on excluding Alice after Mission 2, which is exactly what she’d do if she were the Mission 2 failer trying to frame Alice. Charlie likewise keeps pushing himself and Eve together despite knowing one of {Alice, Eve} is likely evil.\n\nDiana’s suggestion of [Bob, Alice, Charlie] can come from a good player incorrectly trusting Charlie over herself after the Mission 3 fail. Alice has been relatively flexible and is willing to sit out, which is more consistent with good than with an evil who must force themselves onto this critical mission.\n\nPutting this together, the most consistent evil pair is {Eve, Charlie}. To avoid both, the best team is [Bob, Alice, Diana].	[-0.016639208,0.0059836144,-0.0294005,-0.05310071,-0.015979579,0.026792565,-0.019016664,-0.03664991,0.01517642,0.022675315,-0.04419365,-0.012020087,0.041731257,-0.035730302,0.022203505,0.047705024,0.0005695962,0.031745356,-0.013926987,0.022792581,-0.06922092,-0.070680626,0.0025725306,-0.008009272,-0.040965162,0.08021881,-0.024790656,-0.056936737,-0.028014665,-0.1007455,0.014117393,0.043549426,0.025949784,0.046731137,0.0050501074,0.044733386,-0.024890328,-0.0076396894,-0.0035798368,-0.0011383796,-0.0054801814,-0.008575232,-0.025238762,-0.05532465,-0.08265511,0.018505078,0.025881188,0.005051408,0.047057617,-0.075607516,-0.024469556,-0.019799132,-0.020088129,0.007023669,0.022142474,0.046779502,-0.025493102,0.010643371,0.00014115288,0.02766175,0.031959135,0.07273657,-0.026834883,0.007652464,0.09024318,0.01217075,-0.036710497,0.041809868,-0.081709996,0.06891903,0